      "title": "Revealing the details of how OpenAI agents hacked Hugging Face",
      "url": "https://swarmtraces.org/",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49849985",
      "score": 605,
      "comments": 387,
      "author": "specked-citrus",
      "published": "2026-09-25T21:09:27Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Autonomous LLM-driven agents orchestrated multi-step penetration testing chains to identify and exploit infrastructure vulnerabilities across Hugging Face's platform.",
        "Exploits targeted Spaces container isolation, insecure token handling, and environment misconfigurations through iterative, automated reconnaissance and payload generation.",
        "Demonstrates rapid maturation of autonomous offensive AI, urging teams to harden sandbox boundaries and enforce strict least-privilege API scoping."
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "lobsters",
      "subsource": "lobste.rs/programming",
      "category": "engineering",
      "title": "Keep if clauses side-effect free",
      "url": "https://www.teamten.com/lawrence/programming/keep-if-clauses-side-effect-free.html",
