      "score": 10,
      "comments": 12,
      "author": "gavinmorrow",
      "published": "2026-09-26T03:45:44Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Embedding state mutations inside conditional expressions obscures intent and introduces subtle bugs via short-circuit evaluation order.",
        "Separate queries from commands by extracting mutating logic or I/O into explicit variables before evaluating conditional branches.",
        "Pure predicate functions improve code readability, simplify unit testing, and enable safer compiler optimizations and static analysis."
      ]
    },
